# 14 - Failures and Iterations

## Historical Iteration Log
- **Initial API Integration:** Early REST endpoints suffered from unhandled header validation errors and improper content-type definitions (`json` vs `application/json`), resolved via explicit MIME type enforcement.
- **Memory Latency Hurdles:** Early hardware discovery daemons experienced overhead spikes; resolved by streamlining WMI queries and caching hardware profile descriptors.
